  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nOnce upon a time there was an old mother pig who had one hundred little pigs and not enough food to feed them. So when they were old enough, she sent them out into the world to seek their fortunes. You know the story about the first three little pigs. This is a story about the 92nd little pig.\n\nThe 92nd little pig built a house out of depleted uranium. And the wolf was like, \"dude what's with the funky house.\" \nAnd the 92nd little pig was like, \"dude, what's your problem.\"\nAnd the wolf was like, \"dude, I'm just saying, it's kind of a funky house.\"\nThe 92nd little pig agreed, it was a bit unusual to built a house out of deplete uranium, but it was what they had at hand.\n\"Well, are you going to try to enter my house or not?\", replied the pig from the comfort of their home.\n\nThe wolf looked up and down the house, and paused before speaking, \"I don't know man, it's kind of weird.\" The wolf was usually accustomed to breaking in to typical houses, made up of wood, brick, or some other cheap material. But depleted uranium was a whole other matter, it was certainly much more sturdier than the previous houses they had broken into.\n\n\"Well, I'm going to bed, you can try to break in if you want, but I'm not going to be up for any longer, spoke the 92nd little pig to the wolf\". And sure enough, they went into the comfort of their bed, wondering a bit if the wolf would break into their house, while they slumbered.\n\nThe wolf still outside, looked up at the house, and thought about how to get in.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 38,
  "reference_text": " They blew on the doors, the outside walls, and even tried scratching the windows, all seemingly resistant to his claws and might. He tried climbing up the house, but found himself loosing his grip and unable to reach the roof. The wolf was getting frustrated, he had usually entered a past household by now.",
